                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "*Edit-  They listened to the criticism about the shooting and the latest update is a big improvement in my book.  The game feels great now!  So I'll leave my original review for context,  but know that I can wholeheartedly recommend this game even more than before.  \n\n*Original review- This is a good game,  but it could be a great one if the problem of the shots coming from so far behind you is fixed.  It really kills a lot of the fun to be shooting at everything and bullets are flying from 20' behind you.  It makes it feel like you can't really aim at anything,  almost like you're pointing at stuff that someone else is shooting at.  That said,  it's still a thumbs up for being an excellent rollercoaster VR with a high level of polish and content for the price. \n\nIt didn't make me sick and I giggled like a schoolgirl on a rollercoaster with guns.",
